  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kome Island, Tanzania, Health Promotion of Children through Environmental Improvement of Community Health and Sanitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To improve nutrition for children2. To promote growth and development by preventing parasite infections3. To raise awareness on health in communities1.1 To establish school feeding programs1.2 To systematize managing School Management Committees1.3 To support children nutrition management and monitoring2.1 To support WASH facilities in schools and communities2.2 To systematize WASH Committee operations2.3 To support the treatment and monitoring of parasite infections3.1 To provide government officials and community members with training to improve health awareness3.2 To provide school-based people with training to improve health awareness</narrative>
  </description>
